mpat suzhen-dbf mpdel_qmark suzhen-dbf fahai_war
mpat suzhen-dbf mpadd_qmark suzhen-dbf fahaiwar_over -1 0 0 0 0 1
mpecho 和尚被解決了，回去找白素貞回報(reprot)吧。
mppurge all
mppurge self
~
