#11042
Reindeer-roc Red-Nosed-roc Rudolph-roc~
[1;31m紅鼻子[m的魯道夫(Rudolph the Red-Nosed)~
一隻超巨大的[1;31m紅鼻子馴鹿[m(Red-Nosed Reindeer)在這裡發著羊癲瘋。
